{"id":"wb-7-993","name":"观音寺石塔","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"观音寺石塔","text":"观音寺石塔原名千佛塔，位于浙江省温州市瑞安市隆山周湖村万松山南麓。塔建于北宋熙宁元年（1068年），为楼阁式石塔，平面六边形，塔原高七层，现存六层，残高7.8米。1963年3月11日列入浙江省文物保护单位，2013年5月列入第七批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%A7%82%E9%9F%B3%E5%AF%BA%E7%9F%B3%E5%A1%94","revisionId":86834661,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86834661","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/341aa34ce7267d01f6ac9aae.jpg","title":"瑞安观音寺石塔,_2021-05-02_04.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E7%91%9E%E5%AE%89%E8%A7%82%E9%9F%B3%E5%AF%BA%E7%9F%B3%E5%A1%94,_2021-05-02_04.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/1a/%E7%91%9E%E5%AE%89%E8%A7%82%E9%9F%B3%E5%AF%BA%E7%9F%B3%E5%A1%94%2C_2021-05-02_04.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Siyuwj","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​瑞安观音寺石塔","width":320,"height":214}}